OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stan Tracey
OL,6,     F1/5. Kate Molleson is joined by
OL,7,     FClark Tracey to explore the life
OL,8,     Fand work of his father, pianist
OL,9,     Fand composer Stan Tracey.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FPianist Paul Lewis chats to Katie
OL,12,     Fahead of concerts in Bath and
OL,13,     FLondon. Tony nominated singer Ann
OL,14,     FHampton Callaway performs songs by
OL,15,     FCole Porter.
OL,16,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,17,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,19,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,20,     FDvorak, Louise Farrenc and
OL,21,     FArcangelo Corelli.
